    "sections": {
        "description": "NXT Chiropractor is a clean, modern WordPress theme designed specifically for chiropractic clinics, physiotherapy centers, and wellness professionals. It features a fully responsive layout, ensuring your website looks great on all devices. With easy customization options, pre-designed sections, and intuitive navigation, you can quickly showcase services, team members, testimonials, and contact information. The theme is optimized for performance and SEO, helping improve your online visibility. Integration with popular plugins makes appointment booking and patient interaction seamless. NXT Chiropractor offers a professional online presence that builds trust and helps grow your healthcare practice efficiently and effectively online."
